 0?utm_source=luma)\n* ​[Senior Product Manager](https://jobs.dayforcehcm
 .com/en-US/qfg/CANDIDATEPORTAL/jobs/18010?utm_source=luma)\n\n**About ​[
 TechTO](https://www.techto.org/?utm_source=luma)**\nTechTO is Canada’s l
 argest community of tech builders - connecting 70\,000+ founders\, operato
 rs\, and investors through year-round meetups\, curated dinners\, peer tab
 les\, and media storytelling. Learn more here: [https://www.techto.org/](h
 ttps://www.techto.org/?utm_source=luma)\n\n**About [Questrade](https://www
 .questrade.com/?utm_source=luma)**\n​For 27 years\, we’ve remained ind
 ependent and 100% Canadian-owned. We are a 13x winner of Canada’s Best M
 anaged Companies and a 2x winner of Canada’s Top 100 Employers. Our ecos
 ystem includes Questrade\, Questbank\, Questrade Wealth Management\, Commu
 nity Trust\, Zolo\, and Flexiti\, all working together to help Canadians b
 ecome financially secure through cutting-edge technology.\n\n​We’re bu
 ilding something worth being part of. Come see for yourself
