SUMMARY:Together Vancouver
DESCRIPTION:TechTO\n​​This is a paid event. Please buy tickets through
  this link: https://luma.com/together-vancouver-nov-24-2026\n\nTogether Va
 ncouver brings the local tech community together for an evening of connect
 ion\, inspiration\, and real conversations.\n\n​Every founder hits setba
 cks and moments when they’re not sure what comes next. On stage\, founde
 rs and leaders share those parts of their journey\, from the hard decision
 s to the turning points that shaped their companies.\n\n**​👀 What to 
 expect**\n\n​🎤 Hear honest stories from founders who have dreamed big
 \, struggled\, and persevered\n🤝 Meet hundreds of builders\, operators\
 , and investors\n💡 Have conversations that challenge how you think abou
 t your own company or your career\n\n​Whether you are launching your fir
 st venture\, growing a team\, or exploring what is next in your career\, t
 here's a seat here for you.\n\n**​📝 Agenda**\n\n​6:00–7:00 PM \\|
  Doors open and networking\n​7:00–8:30 PM \\| Community open mic\\\, s
 peaker presentations\\\, and fireside chat\n​8:30\\-9:00 PM \\| Resume n
 etworking\n\n**Thank you to our venue partner: [Onni Capital](https://onni
 .capital/?utm_source=luma)**
