DESCRIPTION:TechTO\n​This is a paid event. Please buy a ticket through t
 his link: https://luma.com/canadian-rocketships-dec-1-2026\n\nJoin us at T
 oronto City Hall for our annual event\, where we spotlight the fastest-gro
