 g points\, hard calls\, and lessons that got them here.\n\n​Whether you
 ’re building your first startup or scaling your team\, you’ll meet the
  people shaping what comes next in Canadian tech.\n\n**​📝 Agenda**\n\
 n​6:30–7:00 PM \\| Open networking\n​7:00–8:00 PM \\| Community op
 en mic and speaker presentations\n​8:00–8:30 PM \\| Resume networking\
